notable_snippets:
API example (curl):

curl -X PATCH "https://api.redwoodinference.com/v1/routes/rt_123" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDWOOD_API_KEY" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "quantization_profile": {
      "mode": "enabled",
      "profile_ref": "qp_llama3-70b-instruct_int8w8a8_v3"
    }
  }'

Notes: If `profile_ref` is incompatible with the resolved model variant or the underlying hardware class, the API returns a 409 with a structured error and remediation guidance. If the route is configured with a compatible ref but a specific region/tier cannot apply it at runtime, the request may safely fall back to baseline precision (observable via `quant_profile_resolution=fallback`).
